            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "RubyBroth6504"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved this recipe! I changed the sugar to icing sugar as per previous reviewer. Also, I wanted a mocha type flavour, so reduced the cocoa powder by 1 tablespoon, and substituted it with 1 tablespoon vanilla custard powder. Delish! Thankyou for sharing.",
            "datePublished": "2024-08-25T04:33:43.539Z"
          },
          {
