            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Andi Kuhn Graham"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Doubled this recipe for a layer cake and used my KitchenAid with paddle blade. Super quick, easy and delicious! My new go-to light frosting. It was a bit on the chocolately side for me so I added about a 1/4 c. of powdered sugar to sweeten it up a bit. Next time I'll probably just leave out some cocoa.",
            "datePublished": "2011-12-15T12:29:51.053Z"
